      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 291.74,
      "end_seconds": 300.95,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "Actually, I remember he had some kind of reaction to tramadol before. I couldn't swear to it."
